          "text": "## Attributes Details\n\nI've gotten as far as defining attributes and pre-filled the following details:\n\n- **Name**: Exclusive Rewards for Loyal Credit Card Users\n- **Description**: Reward loyal customers with exclusive offers on credit cards if they use their card twice a month.\n- **Product & Services**: U+ Bank Gold Credit Card\n- **Outcome**: Retain\n\nI need some additional information:\n\n- **Keycode**: (a unique identifier for tracking the campaign)\n- **Product ID**: (the identifier for this card product) In the past you have used \"A1455\"\n\nOnce we have those details, we can define the availability next.",
